  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kudobuilder/kuttl/tarball/v0.28.0",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kudobuilder/kuttl/zipball/v0.28.0",
  "body": "## 🚀 Highlights\r\n\r\n- feat: add TestCase/TestRunSelector to skip a test case (#730)\r\n- feat: dump remaining namespace contents when deletion times out (#737)\r\n\r\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- fix: run collectors on early step errors too (#735)\r\n- fix: handle variable fractional seconds in junit golden normalization (#736)\r\n\r\n## 🔧  Other Changes\r\n\r\n- chore: replace `interface{}` -> `any` (#726)\r\n- ci: migrate release-drafter category labels to 'when' condition (#727)\r\n\r\n## 🌱 Dependency bumps\r\n\r\n- chore(deps): bump github.com/moby/moby/client from 0.6.0 to 0.6.2 (#732, #734)\r\n- chore(deps): bump github.com/moby/moby/api from 1.56.0 to 1.56.1 (#733)\r\n- chore(deps): bump sigs.k8s.io/controller-tools from 0.22.0 to 0.23.0 in the kubernetes group (#738)\r\n- chore(deps): bump sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime from 0.25.1 to 0.25.2 in the kubernetes group (#731)\r\n- chore(deps): bump the kubernetes group with 5 updates (#729)\r\n\r\n## Contributors\r\n\r\n@chenwng, @georgRusanov, @porridge, @pujitha24 and [@dependabot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/dependabot)\r\n",
  "mentions_count": 4
